 Fundraising 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 • First Round Capital is raising $325m for its tenth flagship fund, per an SEC filing. firstround.com 

 • Exponent raised a €750m single-asset CV for H&amp;MV Engineering , an Irish provider of high-voltage engineering and power infrastructure services. Backers include Apollo S3, Pantheon, and SQ Capital. axios.link/4wkLzc0 

 
 
